@startuml
' reviewmesh — CUC-3 "Configure or repair (interactive wizard)" activity diagram. Render: plantuml -tsvg docs/diagrams/activity-setup.puml
title Configure or repair the environment — wizard (CUC-3)
skinparam shadowing false

start
if (interactive surface?) then (no)
  :Print actionable guidance & exit non-zero (RB-17);
  stop
else (yes)
endif
if (entry?) then (setup)
  :Detect adapters (present, path, auth);
  :SetupEngine.SuggestLanes(detected, roles);
  repeat :for each requested role;
    :Choose adapter (default = suggestion);
    if (binary on PATH?) then (no)
      repeat :Ask for binary path;
        :SetupEngine.ValidatePath (exists, exec, probes as adapter);
      repeat while (valid?) is (no, retry) not (yes / cancel)
    else (yes)
    endif
    :Select / enter model + thinking level;
  repeat while (more roles?) is (yes) not (no)
  :SetupEngine.PlanConfig -> ConfigPatch; show summary;
  if (confirm?) then (yes)
    :ConfigAccess.Write(scope, patch);
  else (no)
    :Cancel (nothing written);
    stop
  endif
else (repair)
  repeat :for each doctor issue;
    :SetupEngine.RepairActions(issue) by halt class;
    :Explain issue; choose an action;
    if (action) then (reauthenticate / Class A)
      :Run or show the adapter login (no config write);
    else (path / model / swap / edit)
      :Ask value; validate/probe; ConfigAccess.Write(scope, patch);
    endif
  repeat while (more issues?) is (yes) not (no)
endif
:Run doctor to confirm;
if (all pass?) then (yes)
  :Report ready;
  stop
else (no)
  :Offer repair for remaining issues / report;
  stop
endif
legend bottom
This is the TARGET CUC-3 algorithm. Current build (bounded):
* interactive setup wizard (setup, interactive mode) = profile-to-configure choice (defaultProfile never repointed) + validated adapter binary-path capture + per-role lane model selection from the catalog (when a lane's adapter has >=2 entries) + summary + confirm + post-write doctor;
* interactive guided repair (doctor fix, interactive mode) = adapter binary-path repair only (non-adapter issues stay guidance-only);
* user->project promotion (selected keys only).
Target/future: SuggestLanes (pre-filter), pre-write live identity probe, reauthenticate/model/swap repairs.
endlegend
@enduml
